 secubox-core (>= 1.0),
 python3-uvicorn | python3-pip,
 lxc,
 curl
Recommends: nginx
Description: SecuBox Jitsi Meet - Video Conferencing (LXC-native)
 Jitsi Meet running natively in an unprivileged Debian LXC: prosody (XMPP),
 jicofo (focus), jitsi-videobridge2 (media) and an internal nginx serving the
 web app. The host only routes: HAProxy terminates TLS for the public
 hostname and proxies to the container.
 .
 Replaces the 1.0.0 module, which generated a docker-compose.yml and drove
 docker/podman from the API request path.
 .
 Features:
  - Native LXC deployment, one systemd unit per Jitsi service
  - jitsictl: the single audited root surface (WebUI delegates, never acts)
  - Videobridge NAT harvester wiring for media behind two NATs
  - Per-service restart without cycling the container
 .
 Provides FastAPI backend on /api/v1/jitsi/ via Unix socket.